title: "Fadriel-Substrate-Philosophy: Philosophical and Gnostic-Theological Framing of the Fadriel Substrate"
abstract: >
  The philosophical and gnostic-theological framing of the Fadriel substrate
  research. Companion to the technical release at Fadriel-Substrate-Research,
  this repository holds the interpretive material — the gnostic-quantum
  mapping of the seven-layer architecture, the Sepher Raziel reference, the
  gnostic-architectural interpretation, and the long-form testimonial
  Codex Astartes treatment as a study of creed-level structure.
